    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tea and walks dont really change the fact that it's all just empty. it feels more like a way to distract myself from the nothingness rather than actually dealing with it. if nothing matters, then all the struggle is just... unnecessary, right? why keep fighting a battle that has no prize at the end?",
